drylab-onlyoffice: a modified version of ONLYOFFICE Docs Community
==================================================================

This repository builds a MODIFIED VERSION of ONLYOFFICE Docs (Document
Server) Community Edition 10.0.0.1, the original software developed by
Ascensio System SIA (https://www.onlyoffice.com). It is based on the
upstream image onlyoffice/documentserver:10.0.0.1 and on the upstream
source at https://github.com/ONLYOFFICE/DocumentServer (tag v10.0.0.1).

ONLYOFFICE is a trademark of Ascensio System SIA. This build is not an
official ONLYOFFICE product and is not endorsed by Ascensio System SIA. We
refer to it only as "based on ONLYOFFICE Docs".

Modified by: Drylab (GitHub organisation Drylab-AI)
Date(s) of modification: 2026-11-23

What was modified (web-apps only; server, sdkjs and binaries are unchanged)
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

1. Added web-apps/apps/common/main/resources/drylab/drylab.css (source:
   drylab-theme/drylab.css). A CSS theme for the light "White" interface
   theme: white header row, tabs styled as plain text menu items, the
   toolbar as one rounded light pill, a soft grey canvas around the page, a
   slimmer status bar, a smaller and muted (still visible) ONLYOFFICE logo,
   and Drylab's green as the accent colour. It also adds a line to the
   About panel stating that this is a modified version, by whom and when,
   that it is based on ONLYOFFICE Docs by Ascensio System SIA, the licence,
   and where the modified source is.

2. Edited web-apps/apps/{documenteditor,spreadsheeteditor,presentationeditor}
   /main/index.html: one <link> to drylab.css inserted before </head>, with
   an HTML comment stating the modification and its date (script:
   scripts/patch-index.sh, run in the Dockerfile).

3. Regenerated the precompressed (.gz) copies of the touched files when the
   image has them.

Nothing else was changed. ONLYOFFICE's copyright notices, licence notices,
the About panel (with Ascensio System SIA's details) and the logo are kept.

